    <string name="home_disclaimer_title">Honest limits</string>
    <string name="home_disclaimer_body">CleanDroid is 100%% offline: it has no INTERNET permission, so nothing can leave your device. The shredder overwrites files 3× but no userspace app can guarantee physical erasure on flash storage (journaling, wear leveling). The antivirus layer flags risky permission combinations and known APK hashes — it is a review aid, not a full commercial AV engine. Bloatware "removal" for pure system apps means Android\'s Disable function.</string>

